  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n((7)/({16)} div 10(1)/(2) of 7(1)/(5)) times 3(3)/(5) - 1(1)/(3) times 1(1)/(8) div (1)/(2) + (3)/(4)\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/5150c5b90ff0d3fbdd6a542cbd6ec09a59c26abaae848bd31e3bf0035c4d0714.png] **\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n((7)/({16)} div 10(1)/(2) of 7(1)/(5)) times 3(3)/(5) - 1(1)/(3) times 1(1)/(8) div (1)/(2) + (3)/(4)\n\n⇒ ((7)/({16)} div (21)/(2) of (36)/(5)) times 3(3)/(5) - 1(1)/(3) times 1(1)/(8) div (1)/(2) + (3)/(4)\n\n⇒ ((7)/({16)} div (378)/(5)) times 3(3)/(5) - 1(1)/(3) times 1(1)/(8) div (1)/(2) + (3)/(4)\n\n⇒ ((7)/({16)} times (5)/(378)) times 3(3)/(5) - 1(1)/(3) times 1(1)/(8) div (1)/(2) + (3)/(4)\n\n⇒ ((7)/({16)} times (5)/(378)) times 3(3)/(5) - 1(1)/(3) times 1(1)/(8) div (1)/(2) + (3)/(4)\n\n⇒ (5)/(864) times (18)/(5) - (4)/(3) times (9)/(8) times (2)/(1) + (3)/(4)\n\n⇒ (5)/(864) times (18)/(5) - (4)/(3) times (9)/(4) + (3)/(4)\n\n⇒ (1)/(48)- 3 + (3)/(4)\n\n⇒ (1 - 144 + 36)/(48)\n\n⇒ ( - 107)/(48)\n\n**∴ Required answer is ( - 107)/(48).**",
